pageType: evidence
background:
  type: solid
  color: $paper
notes: |
  2020 至 2024 年，中国跨境电商进出口规模由 1.62 万亿元增至 2.71 万亿元，增幅约 67%。2021 年公开材料存在 1.92 万亿元与修订后 1.98 万亿元两种口径，因此留空。
  来源：商务部《中国电子商务报告 2022》、商务部电子商务公共服务网 2023 与海关总署 2024 更新统计。
elements:
  - elementId: scale-cyan-rail
    elementType: shape
    bounds:
      - 0
      - 0
      - 10
      - 540
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: $cyan
    border:
      color: $cyan
      width: 0
  - elementId: scale-title-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds:
      - 46
      - 118
      - 868
      - 1
    viewBox:
      - 868
      - 1
    points: 0,0 868,0
    border:
      color: $rule
      width: 0.9
  - elementId: scale-left-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds:
      - 354
      - 146
      - 1
      - 278
    viewBox:
      - 1
      - 278
    points: 0,0 0,278
    border:
      color: $rule
      width: 0.8
  - elementId: scale-gap-field
    elementType: shape
    bounds:
      - 46
      - 388
      - 270
      - 72
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: $clay
    border:
      color: $clay
      width: 0
  - elementId: scale-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 46
      - 24
      - 500
      - 16
    content:
      text: SCALE TRAJECTORY / 2020—2024
      fontFamily: &ref_0
        latin: Arial
        ea: Noto Sans CJK SC
        mac: PingFang SC
        win: Microsoft YaHei
      fontSize: 8
      bold: true
      letterSpacing: 1.05
      color: $muted
  - elementId: scale-title
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 46
      - 52
      - 850
      - 42
    content:
      style: $title
      text: 四年规模增长约 67%，行业仍处于扩张区间
  - elementId: scale-big
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 46
      - 152
      - 270
      - 76
    content:
      text: +67%
      fontFamily: &ref_1
        latin: Arial
        ea: Noto Sans CJK SC
        mac: PingFang SC
        win: Microsoft YaHei
      fontSize: 62
      bold: true
      letterSpacing: -1.8
      color: $navy
  - elementId: scale-big-label
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 50
      - 230
      - 250
      - 38
    content:
      text: 2024 较 2020<br>根据海关披露数据计算
      fontFamily: *ref_0
      fontSize: 10
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.35
      color: $ink
  - elementId: scale-current
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 48
      - 302
      - 126
      - 40
    content:
      text: '2.71'
      fontFamily: *ref_1
      fontSize: 32
      bold: true
      color: $cyan
  - elementId: scale-current-label
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 168
      - 307
      - 144
      - 34
    content:
      text: 万亿元<br>2024 更新统计
      fontFamily: *ref_0
      fontSize: 9
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.3
      color: $ink
  - elementId: scale-gap-label
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 60
      - 400
      - 240
      - 50
    content:
      text: '2021 / 口径留空<br><span style="font-size: 8.5px">1.92 与修订后 1.98 两种公开口径，不拼成连续序列。</span>'
      fontFamily: *ref_0
      fontSize: 10.5
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.35
      color: $ink
  - elementId: scale-chart
    elementType: chart
    bounds:
      - 390
      - 156
      - 510
      - 262
    data:
      cols:
        - year
        - value
      rows:
        - - '2020'
          - 1.62
        - - '2022'
          - 2.11
        - - '2023'
          - 2.38
        - - 2024 更新
          - 2.71
    series:
      - type: line
        name: 进出口规模
        encode:
          x: year
          'y': value
        lineColor: $navy
        width: 2.5
        marker:
          shape: circle
          size: 7
          fill: $cyan
          lineColor: $navy
        dataLabels:
          show: false
    xAxis:
      label:
        fontSize: 8.5
        color: $muted
      gridLine: false
    yAxis:
      min: 1.4
      max: 3
      label:
        fontSize: 8
        color: $muted
      gridLine:
        color: $rule
        style: dot
    legend:
      show: false
    fontFamily: *ref_0
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: '#F3F0EA00'
    border:
      color: '#F3F0EA00'
      width: 0
